Cell[TextData[{"Vectors sharing one index multiply elementwise ", 
              Cell[BoxData[FormBox[RowBox[{SubscriptBox[RowBox[{"(", 
                      RowBox[{StyleBox["u", "TI"], "\[SmallCircle]", StyleBox[
                         "v", "TI"]}], ")"}], "i"], "=", RowBox[
                    {SubscriptBox[StyleBox["u", "TI"], "i"], SubscriptBox[
                      StyleBox["v", "TI"], "i"]}]}], TraditionalForm]], 
